│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mHow to tell what's high signal comes down to keeping gathering and judging apart:[39m            [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m1. [1m[38;2;197;201;199mGather wide and cheap.[0m[38;2;197;201;199m[48;2;47;48;54m Grok for X, web search, feeds, blogs. It collects lots of junk,[39m    [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mand that's fine.[39m                                                                             [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m2. [1m[38;2;197;201;199mFilter with a decision model.[0m[38;2;197;201;199m[48;2;47;48;54m Score each item against a short written profile per[39m         [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mdomain: what counts as signal for you there, with good and bad examples. Jev already does[39m    [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mthis kind of scoring, and dpi's backend already has a Jev client. It's fast and cheap, and[39m   [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mit scores items the same way each time.[39m                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m3. [1m[38;2;197;201;199mSynthesize with a strong model.[0m[38;2;197;201;199m[48;2;47;48;54m Only what passes the filter goes to Opus or Sonnet for[39m    [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mthe report or strategy. That's where the Anthropic credit should go.[39m                         [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m4. [1m[38;2;197;201;199mYour feedback is the tuning.[0m[38;2;197;201;199m[48;2;47;48;54m You mark items keep or drop. Those marks become the[39m          [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mprofile's examples and a test set, so you can measure whether the filter is improving. You[39m   [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199malready have that measuring tool from experiment 007: jev-bench, which compares Jev against[39m  [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mhand labels.[39m                                                                                 [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mYour "fine-tune over time" is step 4. For now it means improving the profile and threshold[39m   [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199magainst your marks, not retraining a model.[39m                                                  [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                [38;2;67;70;78m
